cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  For discussion of this private review snapshot, identify its Git commit and
  version. Public citation metadata will be finalized at wider release.
type: software
title: A Linear Barrier for Bounded-Arity Information Inequalities in Secret Sharing
version: 0.8.1
authors:
  - family-names: Williamson
    given-names: Christopher
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of an explicit linear ceiling, for every fixed arity,
  on the maximum-share objective of the specified information-inequality and
  prescribed-field rank relaxations for secret sharing. Developed with
  substantial ChatGPT assistance; see AI_ASSISTANCE.md.
